    "text": "klin.com\nwebsite\nLincoln\nCity Seeks Input on Changes to N. 84th & Cornhusker Highway Intersection\nBy Chase Porter,17 hours ago\nLincoln Transportation and Utilities (LTU) is looking for feedback on proposed changes to the North 84th Street and U.S. Highway 6/Cornhusker Highway intersection. The planned project would replace the existing traffic signal with a roundabout. Roundabouts typically cost less than signalized intersections and increase safety by providing fewer conflict points, slower speeds, and shorter wait times.\nComments / 1\nLoading editor...",
